Description: Kidux learning module: Hello on the web, a first page as a web page
 Kidux is a Debian derivative for a child's first computer. This learning
 module is the first page to read again, as a web page shown in Chromium:
 the smallest learning module made of web pages, and a way to see that they
 work on this computer. A link on it to a page on the internet stays
 closed, as every link out of a learning module does.
 .
 Once it is installed, an adult switches it on for each child on the
 Modules page of the adult panel.
